Enable the existing ELF context ABI and loader environment on NetBSD.

Adapted for KiCad 10.0.7 from pkgsrc cad/kicad patches at
fff4deb639a1a640476203c80f752fb77b6cb14b:
patch-include_kiway.h (NetBSD revision 1.3, 2019-06-14) and
patch-thirdparty_libcontext_libcontext.h (revision 1.1, 2022-01-02).
The compiler branch already accepts GCC and Clang. No assembly is changed.
Adaptation: EmberBSD (AI-assisted).

